{"seq":31,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w00580"},"reason":"Question written for the Quiztopia extended deck (an unprinted fact of the card's article).","by":"Quiztopia import","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"What is the name of the lamp that burns continuously beside the tabernacle in Catholic churches to signal the presence of the Blessed Sacrament?"},{"field":"de","new":"Wie heißt die Lampe, die in katholischen Kirchen ständig beim Tabernakel brennt und die Gegenwart des Allerheiligsten anzeigt?"}]},
