{"seq":34,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0116"},"reason":"Added the pyx (communion to the sick, its Greek name, the Trial of the Pyx) to the chalice-and-paten passage and the table, so the new question about it sits in a sentence that gives it.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",965],["+"," When communion is taken to the sick and housebound, the priest or minister carries the hosts in a pyx, a small round, usually gilded box, often in a pouch on a cord around the neck. Its name comes from the Greek pyxis, a box of boxwood – the same word that names the box of sample coins in England's Trial of the Pyx, recorded since 1248."],["=",247],["+","pyx | Small box in which communion is carried to the sick |\n| "],["=",23]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",881],["+"," Wird die Kommunion zu Kranken und Gebrechlichen gebracht, trägt der Priester die Hostien in einer kleinen runden, meist vergoldeten Dose, oft in einem Täschchen an einer Schnur um den Hals: Dieses Gefäß heißt Pyxis. Der Name kommt vom griechischen pyxis, einer Büchse aus Buchsbaumholz – dasselbe Wort bezeichnet die Münzbüchse der englischen Münzprüfung „Trial of the Pyx“, die seit 1248 bezeugt ist."],["=",241],["+","Pyxis | Kleine Dose, in der die Kommunion zu Kranken gebracht wird |\n| "],["=",23]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",833],["+"," Когда причастие несут больным и немощным, священник переносит гостии в особом сосуде — это пиксида, маленькая круглая, обычно позолоченная коробочка, которую часто носят в мешочке на шнурке на шее. Название происходит от греческого pyxis — «шкатулка из самшита»; тем же словом называется ящик с образцами монет в английском «Испытании пиксиды», известном с 1248 года."],["=",215],["+","пиксида | Коробочка, в которой причастие несут больным |\n| "],["=",23]]}],"hash":"d0ec9be546ab"},
{"seq":35,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"marked","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f00580"},"reason":"Answer marks moved because new text was inserted into the body before them; the marked sentence is unchanged.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[2795,14],"de":[3065,12],"ru":[2961,18]},"new":{"en":[3134,14],"de":[3467,12],"ru":[3329,18]}}],"hash":"c4b510619035"},
{"seq":36,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28405"},"reason":"New question added to grow the article from five to six facts: What is the name of the small, usually round container in which a priest carries consecrated hosts to the sick and housebound? (answer: pyx), verified against the cited sources.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pyx"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trial_of_the_Pyx"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"pyx"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Pyxis"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"пиксида"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[2787,3],"de":[3143,5],"ru":[2953,7]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"event","start":"1248-02-24","end":null,"precision":"day","approx":false,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"Earliest record of England's Trial of the Pyx, named after the pyx, the coin box","labelDe":"Früheste Erwähnung der englischen Münzprüfung „Trial of the Pyx“, benannt nach der Pyxis, der Münzbüchse","labelRu":"Первое упоминание английского «Испытания пиксиды», названного по ящику для монет"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pyx","title":"Pyx – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"c39ec30b3f06"},
{"seq":37,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27405"},"reason":"Open-question wording (EN/DE/RU) for the new fact.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"What is the name of the small, usually round container in which a priest carries consecrated hosts to the sick and housebound?"},{"field":"de","new":"Wie heißt das kleine, meist runde Gefäß, in dem ein Priester geweihte Hostien zu Kranken und Gebrechlichen bringt?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Как называется маленький, обычно круглый сосуд, в котором священник приносит освящённые гостии больным и немощным?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28405"}],"hash":"64bd37f45fed"},
